{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://sevorix.com/", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><!-- Last Published: Thu Aug 20 2026 22:10:13 GMT+0000 (Coordinated Universal Time) --><html data-wf-domain=\"sevorix.com\" data-wf-page=\"69a6a7af7ec6768c1bfc26e5\" data-wf-site=\"69a6a7ae7ec6768c1bfc26dc\" lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"/><link href=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com\" rel=\"preconnect\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"/><title>Runtime Containment for AI Agents | Kernel-Level Enforcement | Sevorix</title><meta content=\"Runtime containment for autonomous AI agents. Kernel-level enforcement evaluates every shell command, outbound request, and syscall before execution \u2014 with Ring-0 blocks, L1 cache hits, and sub-50ms Jury escalation.\" name=\"description\"/><meta content=\"Sevorix | Runtime Containment for Autonomous AI Agents\" property=\"og:title\"/><meta content=\"Runtime containment for autonomous AI agents. Shell commands, outbound requests, and syscalls are evaluated at the kernel before they execute \u2014 Ring-0 blocks resolve with no round trip; cache hits return in nanoseconds; Jury escalation stays inside a sub-50ms budget.\" property=\"og:description\"/><meta content=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a6a7ae7ec6768c1bfc26dc/69b370fd1edc4b10bb5371c4_homepage.png\" property=\"og:image\"/><meta content=\"Sevorix | Runtime Containment for Autonomous AI Agents\" name=\"twitter:title\"/><meta content=\"Runtime containment for autonomous AI agents. Shell commands, outbound requests, and syscalls are evaluated at the kernel before they execute \u2014 Ring-0 blocks resolve with no round trip; cache hits return in nanoseconds; Jury escalation stays inside a sub-50ms budget.\" name=\"twitter:description\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta content=\"summary_large_image\" name=\"twitter:card\"/><meta content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" name=\"viewport\"/><link href=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69a6a7ae7ec6768c1bfc26dc/cs